{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AJmB3xAU5jhP1gdYmJj1KB","type":"tool_result","content":"=== creative licence / prd-readiness ===\n241:| `prd` | `faffter-noon-prd` | Code-blind PRD-admissibility **producer** for the L4 run-start gate: given only a PRD document (never the codebase/tracker), it judges whether the PRD's stop-conditions are machine-verifiable and how wide the implementation's creative licence is, and emits a `faff-contract:prd-readiness` block the run-start pre-step pipes to `faff contract prd-readiness` (the deterministic validator: `admissible` → admit the run; anything else → refuse, fail-safe). A producer doing-skill. |","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01B5EZakvE3ogy965XNLhXi4","session_id":"21bdc136-befe-4bc5-9026-5312f63ae86b","uuid":"86a27ed3-6a05-4211-9c99-5ae9be421672","timestamp":"2026-09-01T00:32:32.512Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Plot PRD into epics and PRDRs"}
