{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011Cebn6e5bK7Mts9kBsK9uo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LJ9ud3jZtCTCapVwBoKWPX","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/shftwst/workspace/shftwst/faff-sut-p1-link-shortener-l4-3; echo \"=== prd slot ===\"; faff config get slots.prd 2>&1; echo \"=== prd-readiness contract ===\"; faff contract prd-readiness --describe 2>&1 | head -60","description":"Check prd slot and readiness contract"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1575,"cache_read_input_tokens":55291,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1575,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01B5EZakvE3ogy965XNLhXi4","session_id":"21bdc136-befe-4bc5-9026-5312f63ae86b","uuid":"0574174d-f38c-403e-a427-013cecf8820b","timestamp":"2026-09-01T00:32:46.630Z","request_id":"req_011Cebn6beVkMpcJvSb7aJ13","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Plot PRD into epics and PRDRs"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LJ9ud3jZtCTCapVwBoKWPX","type":"tool_result","content":"=== prd slot ===\nfaffter-noon-prd\n=== prd-readiness contract ===\n# faff contract prd-readiness\n\nThe product-axis analog of spec-readiness — whether an L4 run's target container's PRD is admissible (verifiable stop conditions) before the run starts.\n\n## Values\n\n### `verdict`\n\nEnum: `admissible`, `not-ready`\n\n| Value | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `admissible` | the PRD's stop conditions are verifiable — admit the run |\n| `not-ready` | the PRD lacks verifiable stop conditions — refuse and escalate before starting |\n\n### `reason`\n\nEnum: `no-stop-conditions`, `ambiguous-stop-conditions`, `other`\n\n| Value | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `no-stop-conditions` | the PRD declares no stop conditions at all |\n| `ambiguous-stop-conditions` | stop conditions exist but are not verifiable as stated |\n| `other` | a reason outside the named set |\n\n### `creative_licence`\n\nEnum: `broad`, `tight`\n\n| Value | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `broad` | the PRD grants wide creative latitude to the build — calibrates the downstream YAGNI/PRDR reviewer more permissively |\n| `tight` | the PRD constrains the build narrowly — calibrates the downstream reviewer more strictly |\n\n## Coercion & fail direction\n\nExit codes: `0` conformant · `1` violations · `2` fail-loud.\n\n- an out-of-enum verdict or creative_licence → fail-loud (exit 2) — no safe coerce target, faff's own producer emits this\n- not-ready with an empty reason, or admissible with a non-empty reason, or admissible with stop_conditions_verifiable:false → conformant:false\n\n## Envelope\n\n- `verdict` (string, required) — one of {admissible, not-ready}\n- `reason` (string, required)\n- `stop_conditions_verifiable` (boolean, required)\n- `creative_licence` (string, required) — one of {broad, tight}\n- `conformant` (boolean, required)\n- `violations` (array, required)\n\n## Producer notes\n\n- `creative_licence` is shape-checked but not itself gate-decisive — it is forward-carried context for a downstream reviewer, not a pass/fail input here","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01B5EZakvE3ogy965XNLhXi4","session_id":"21bdc136-befe-4bc5-9026-5312f63ae86b","uuid":"b1bb95dd-7418-4f15-9aa1-42aeb31a3900","timestamp":"2026-09-01T00:32:47.324Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Plot PRD into epics and PRDRs"}
