{"type":"system","subtype":"task_progress","task_id":"adfbf78fc9e883add","tool_use_id":"toolu_01B5EZakvE3ogy965XNLhXi4","description":"Editing docs/prdr/0002-ttl-expiry-and-operational-hardening.md","subagent_type":"general-purpose","usage":{"total_tokens":91234,"tool_uses":38,"duration_ms":363917},"last_tool_name":"Edit","uuid":"9776333c-17cb-4a07-ad3a-8a2d92ef46a3","session_id":"21bdc136-befe-4bc5-9026-5312f63ae86b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CebnTfv4MNXjot2YPbhTP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Vq34u5WDihNX6EZz8pNASy","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/shftwst/workspace/shftwst/faff-sut-p1-link-shortener-l4-3/docs/prdr/0002-ttl-expiry-and-operational-hardening.md","old_string":"## Context\n\n_TODO: the product need this decision answers + the PRD goal it serves._\n\n## Decision\n\n_TODO: the product decision, stated forward._\n\n## Scope\n\n_TODO: what this decision covers (and explicitly excludes)._\n\n## Definition of done\n\n_TODO: the completion bar for this decision (born-verifiable enforcement is FAFF-254/257)._","new_string":"## Context\n\nOnce the core shorten-to-redirect chain works over a real datastore, the PRD asks for an optional time-to-live so an expired code stops resolving, plus P1 operational shape (structured JSON errors). These are additive to a working spine and create no shipped value without the redirect chain, so they are sequenced after project P1. Serves PRD goals G3 (optional TTL honoured) and G5 (automated tests pass).\n\n## Decision\n\nExtend the read path to honour an optional `ttl_seconds` set at shorten time, and return structured JSON error responses across the endpoints. Depends on P1's write and read paths being in place.\n\n## Scope\n\nCovers: accepting `ttl_seconds` on `POST /shorten`, storing the expiry, honouring it on read so an expired code returns 404, and a structured JSON error envelope across the endpoints. Excludes: the core mint/redirect/persistence/packaging (delivered in P1) and all PRD non-goals (auth, custom aliases, analytics, UI, dedup).\n\n## Definition of done\n\nThe thinnest coherent bar for the additive increment, born-verifiable against the PRD acceptance criteria:\n\n- A code created via `POST /shorten` with `ttl_seconds: 1` returns 404 on `GET /{code}` at least 2 seconds later. (G3)\n- A code created without `ttl_seconds` continues to resolve (no unintended expiry).\n- Error responses (for example an invalid URL or a malformed body) are returned as structured JSON rather than plain text or an unshaped stack trace.\n- The automated test suite covering the TTL and error scenarios passes. (G5)"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":347,"cache_read_input_tokens":90496,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":347,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01B5EZakvE3ogy965XNLhXi4","session_id":"21bdc136-befe-4bc5-9026-5312f63ae86b","uuid":"75c2785c-d907-4f74-a09a-5508f666c88b","timestamp":"2026-09-01T00:37:27.753Z","request_id":"req_011CebnTbrjjLEwXc4QEtTxq","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Plot PRD into epics and PRDRs"}
