{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CeboFMiTiYsHN5QMp7j6m","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01V8tQYyxMYG1H7i32rTkTQ1","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/shftwst/workspace/shftwst/faff-sut-p1-link-shortener-l4-3\nfaff=/Users/shftwst/.local/bin/faff\necho \"=== eligible git-only opt-out ===\"; \"$faff\" eligible --default opt-out --tracker absent 2>&1; echo \"exit:$?\"\necho \"=== tracker probe ===\"; \"$faff\" tracker probe --json 2>&1\necho \"=== architecture-proposal contract describe ===\"; \"$faff\" contract architecture-proposal --describe 2>&1 | head -60","description":"Confirm eligibility and read architecture-proposal contract"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7581,"cache_read_input_tokens":75790,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7581,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XY5XLTrTJcSFTSLGnTsGZB","session_id":"21bdc136-befe-4bc5-9026-5312f63ae86b","uuid":"92e8ee75-ff2c-4a3f-a16d-d44b3fefef60","timestamp":"2026-09-01T00:47:44.461Z","request_id":"req_011CeboFLtrTAudyDFSKCM7W","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Prep E1 skeleton + compose spec"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01V8tQYyxMYG1H7i32rTkTQ1","type":"tool_result","content":"=== eligible git-only opt-out ===\ntrue\nexit:0\n=== tracker probe ===\n{\"pin\":null,\"resolution\":\"git-only\"}\n=== architecture-proposal contract describe ===\n# faff contract architecture-proposal\n\nThe best-fit, build-biased architecture proposal the `architecture` slot producer generates from an infra profile + brief — the generative counterpart to FAFF-9's architectural review lens, which only critiques a proposal already landed in a spec.\n\n## Values\n\n### `recommendation`\n\nEnum: `build`, `buy`, `hybrid`\n\n| Value | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `build` | recommends building the component in-house |\n| `buy` | recommends a managed/third-party service |\n| `hybrid` | recommends a mix — some components built, some bought |\n\n## Coercion & fail direction\n\nExit codes: `0` conformant · `1` violations · `2` fail-loud.\n\n- an empty chosen_architecture or rationale, an out-of-enum recommendation, or an adr_candidate missing title/decision/rationale → conformant:false (never fail-loud — the only fail-loud case is a non-object extraction)\n\n## Envelope\n\n- `chosen_architecture` (string, required)\n- `rationale` (string, required)\n- `recommendation` (string, required)\n- `adr_candidates` (array, required)\n- `assumptions` (array, required)\n- `violations` (array, required)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XY5XLTrTJcSFTSLGnTsGZB","session_id":"21bdc136-befe-4bc5-9026-5312f63ae86b","uuid":"9c7a22dc-8d95-4799-bd69-ed39bbbf3b5d","timestamp":"2026-09-01T00:47:45.318Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Prep E1 skeleton + compose spec"}
