"minor\",\"claim\":\"The term \\\"structured fatal log\\\" is vague and lacks a pass/fail definition.\",\"evidence\":\"The DONE item \\\"A missing/blank `DATABASE_URL` causes a structured fatal log...\\\"\",\"predicted_consequence\":\"It is impossible to decide if a log is \\\"structured\\\" (e.g., does it require JSON? A specific key-value format? Or just a formatted string?).\",\"spec_anchor\":\"done-from-what-config\"}],\"conformant\":true,\"violations\":[]}\ncontract stderr:","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018uez6EFKiHNDKixT1pCgLF","session_id":"21bdc136-befe-4bc5-9026-5312f63ae86b","uuid":"20c95b09-2619-4f28-a16d-fbba2b6ef3fa","timestamp":"2026-09-01T02:00:03.613Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Resume E1 spec-review gate"}
