own/405/migration/structured-log; round 2: invalid-DSN secret test, non-root scenario, port oracle, DB-Ping-failure scenario, migration-order oracle) → all added as born-verifiable scenarios + DoD items.\n\n**Pacing note (per your guidance):** kept the 2000 output cap throughout. gemini's per-minute quota did burst-429 on the concurrent 4-lens fan-outs (QA, alphabetically last, lost the window twice), but every 429'd lens was served on a solo/backoff retry via the spark→deepseek cascade cooldown — no lens was concluded `unavailable`. The only genuine backend flakiness observed was transient spark-qwen 502s and deepseek empty responses, both of which the chain cascaded past.","usage":{"total_tokens":232625,"tool_uses":64,"duration_ms":2898788},"uuid":"3e18da3f-ce5d-4e50-87d7-d1bbcbb6645a","session_id":"21bdc136-befe-4bc5-9026-5312f63ae86b"}
