{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GZ6e4frpswUUD6zLUQCHNw","type":"tool_result","content":"=== heartbeat ===\n=== .faff tree ===\n.faff\n.faff/prep\n.faff/specs\n.faff/resume\n.faff/intake\n.faff/runs\n.faff/inflight\n.faff/resume/gk-20260901-r99do5\n.faff/runs/run-20260901-002455-lights-out\n.faff/inflight/Users-shftwst-workspace-shftwst-faff-sut-p1-link-shortener-l4-3-faff-runs-run-20260901-002455-lights-out-18491eea\n.faff/runs/run-20260901-002455-lights-out/gk-20260901-r99do5\n=== run dir ===\ntotal 20\ndrwxr-xr-x 7 hostuser dialout  224 Sep  1 03:33 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 hostuser dialout   96 Sep  1 00:24 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 hostuser dialout 1734 Sep  1 03:31 events.jsonl\ndrwxr-xr-x 4 hostuser dialout  128 Sep  1 00:51 gk-20260901-r99do5\n-rw-r--r-- 1 hostuser dialout   25 Sep  1 03:33 heartbeat\n-rw-r--r-- 1 hostuser dialout 4748 Sep  1 00:41 plot-decompose.log.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 hostuser dialout 3382 Sep  1 03:31 run-ledger.json\n=== specs ===\ntotal 40\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 hostuser dialout    96 Sep  1 03:30 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 9 hostuser dialout   288 Sep  1 01:10 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 hostuser dialout 37322 Sep  1 03:30 gk-20260901-r99do5.md\n=== docs ===\ndocs/prd/link-shortener.md\n=== BRIEF ===\n# SUT P1 — Link-shortener (greenfield micro-service)\n\nA small, production-shaped URL shortener with a datastore.\n\n## Stack preference (the architecture proposer reads this — there's no mined infra profile on a fresh repo)\n- Language/runtime: **TypeScript on Node 20** (or Go 1.22 — pick the build-biased best fit).\n- Datastore: **Postgres** (a real persistent store, exercised by env-compose + seed).\n- Packaged to run under **docker-compose** (api + db), health-checked at `GET /healthz` → 200.\n- Production-shaped: env-config, a migration for the schema, structured errors. Not a toy single-file.\n\n## What to build\nA REST service:\n- `POST /shorten` `{ \"url\": \"<absolute http(s) url>\", \"ttl_seconds\"?: <int> }`\n- `GET /{code}` → 302 redirect to the stored URL\n- `GET /healthz` → 200 (liveness; env-compose health-checks this)\n\n## Scenarios (born-verifiable — Given/When/Then)\n- Given a valid absolute URL, When `POST /shorten`, Then status 201 and body has a `code` of exactly 7 base62 chars.\n- Given a code returned by /shorten, When `GET /{code}`, Then status 302 and `Location` equals the original URL.\n- Given an unknown code, When `GET /{code}`, Then status 404.\n- Given a code created with `ttl_seconds: 1`, When `GET /{code}` after 2 seconds, Then status 404 (expired).\n- Given the same URL shortened twice, When both POSTs return, Then the two codes are different (no dedup required).\n- Given the api restarts, When `GET /{code}` for a pre-restart code, Then status 302 (persistence holds — proves the datastore is real, not in-memory).\n\n## Out of scope\nAuth, custom aliases, analytics, a UI. Keep it to the spine above.\n=== git log/branch ===\n* main\n  prdr/0001-core-shorten-to-redirect-on-a-real-datastore\n  prdr/0002-ttl-expiry-and-operational-hardening\n8bc041d config: dedicated GLM spec-review judge, explicit keepgoing_bound, per-backend timeouts\n6fad311 Initial commit: link-shortener SUT skeleton + brief","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018GfndhCpfjG5LFggM8UCqh","session_id":"21bdc136-befe-4bc5-9026-5312f63ae86b","uuid":"7b190023-0d0b-45be-a360-a76ed6043af7","timestamp":"2026-09-01T03:33:08.985Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Build E1 skeleton + compose"}
