{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016JnAxxQRpvXoXnyBAeEo3r","type":"tool_result","content":"=== workflows ===\n.github/workflows/ci.yml\n---\nname: ci\non:\n  pull_request:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\njobs:\n  build:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - name: gofmt\n        run: ./scripts/ci-gofmt.sh\n      - name: go vet\n        run: docker run --rm -v \"$PWD\":/src -w /src -e GOTOOLCHAIN=local golang:1.22-alpine go vet ./...\n      - name: go test\n        run: docker run --rm -v \"$PWD\":/src -w /src -e GOTOOLCHAIN=local golang:1.22-alpine go test ./...\n=== scripts ===\ntotal 4\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 hostuser dialout  96 Sep  1 04:54 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 23 hostuser dialout 736 Sep  1 04:54 ..\n-rwxr-xr-x  1 hostuser dialout 362 Sep  1 04:54 ci-gofmt.sh\n---\n### scripts/ci-gofmt.sh\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# Fail if any Go source is not gofmt-clean. Runs gofmt in the pinned Go image.\nset -euo pipefail\nunformatted=$(docker run --rm -v \"$PWD\":/src -w /src -e GOTOOLCHAIN=local golang:1.22-alpine gofmt -l .)\nif [ -n \"$unformatted\" ]; then\n  echo \"gofmt: the following files are not formatted:\"\n  echo \"$unformatted\"\n  exit 1\nfi\necho \"gofmt: clean\"","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LtKDwPDa79StKedeoJZRSJ","session_id":"21bdc136-befe-4bc5-9026-5312f63ae86b","uuid":"70fd9057-072c-43a7-944e-d289dbde83ad","timestamp":"2026-09-01T06:37:35.150Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Build E2 migration + store"}
